OL,5,G1500 The Seventies
OL,6,     FWhat's Goin' On: American popular
OL,7,     Fmusic explodes into new formats,
OL,8,     Fwhile established artists,
OL,9,     Fincluding Blondie, Billy Joel and
OL,10,     FKISS find new ways to express
OL,11,     Fthemselves. (S1, ep 4)
OL,12,G1600 Discovering: Charles Bronson
OL,13,     FFilm experts reflect on the work
OL,14,     Fof Charles Bronson, who became a
OL,15,     FHollywood star with his tough-guy,
OL,16,     Fvigilante roles in films such as
OL,17,     FThe Magnificent Seven and Death
OL,18,     FWish. (S5, ep 13)
