OL,5,G0105 Dr. Strangelove: National Theatre
OL,6,G     Live
OL,7,     FSteve Coogan plays four roles in
OL,8,     Fthe stage adaptation of Stanley
OL,9,     FKubrick's comedy masterpiece Dr
OL,10,     FStrangelove.
OL,11,G0300 Van Gogh By Vincent
OL,12,     FIn a career that lasted only ten
OL,13,     Fyears, Vincent van Gogh painted
OL,14,     Fone subject more than any other:
OL,15,     Fhimself. This is the story of
OL,16,     FVincent told using eight of his
OL,17,     Fself-portraits.
